                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "436e4855-ec98-3c33-a4a9-d27d75f64af1",
                        "entry_id": "d4aa90de-f791-3c26-aa3f-9970e988eb9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "jemand, der sich öffentlich (mit wirksamen Aktionen) für den Frieden einsetzt; Vertreter/Vertreterin der Friedensbewegung"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1e2c960-5987-4a8c-bc7d-c5a7f76fe86b",
                                "sense_id": "436e4855-ec98-3c33-a4a9-d27d75f64af1",
                                "text": "„Kurz nach Mitternacht im Lincoln Park von Chicago: Polizisten stürmten ein verbarrikadiertes Nachtlager von Hippies, Peaceniks und radikalen Studenten mit dem Schlachtruf: ‚kill, kill, kill.‘“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db0bd45c-5efe-418b-b2b0-0254754c8a5a",
                                "sense_id": "436e4855-ec98-3c33-a4a9-d27d75f64af1",
                                "text": "„Jetzt aber ist Bill Clinton der Commander-in-Chief, und das Verhältnis vieler Soldaten und Veteranen zu dem ehemaligen Peacenik ist schwierig.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a50894f8-2305-44f0-82e0-5ee69ef9e0b5",
                                "sense_id": "436e4855-ec98-3c33-a4a9-d27d75f64af1",
                                "text": "„Der Grund dafür, warum wir die Friedensindustrie nicht größer als die Kriegsindustrie machen können, ist, daß die Peaceniks so unterschiedlich sind.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f88efa43-f784-46b5-b8de-1be9b464441d",
                                "sense_id": "436e4855-ec98-3c33-a4a9-d27d75f64af1",
                                "text": "„Auch zahlreiche Rechte riefen mittlerweile in der ‚Peace Now‘-Zentrale an - die, sagt Raz grinsend, ‚sind einfach entsetzt, daß im Militär so viele Peaceniks sind‘.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a84a49e-85b5-4a42-867a-f7099d89b2fa",
                                "sense_id": "436e4855-ec98-3c33-a4a9-d27d75f64af1",
                                "text": "„Peaceniks waren es, Mitglieder der Friedensbewegung.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08e74605-5740-4372-bbc0-439fcabed46e",
                                "sense_id": "436e4855-ec98-3c33-a4a9-d27d75f64af1",
                                "text": "„Das Image des linken ‚Peaceniks‘ handelte sich Ayalon vor knapp vier Jahren ein, als er mit Professor Sari Nusseibeh, dem Direktor der Ostjerusalemer Al-Kuds-Uni, eine gemeinsame Prinzipienerklärung veröffentlichte.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "22caae8b-4c6b-4f80-9d69-0d6a96232a52",
                                "sense_id": "436e4855-ec98-3c33-a4a9-d27d75f64af1",
                                "text": "„Neuerdings tauchen hier immer mehr Peaceniks auf, die Kerzen anzünden und Taschentücher, auf die Kinder Friedenssymbole gemalt haben, zusammenknoten.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6cf08f6d-26e6-475b-9cad-0019bc8f288c",
                        "source_entry_id": "d4aa90de-f791-3c26-aa3f-9970e988eb9c",
                        "source_sense_id": "436e4855-ec98-3c33-a4a9-d27d75f64af1",
                        "target_lang_word": "peacenik",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "peacenik",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed73966c-6ebf-32a4-aaa8-3aeb6b789ff0",
                                        "entry_id": "3d18a3ff-11ef-328e-b2c5-92c54f0f8e40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who publicly opposes armed conflict in general, or a particular conflict, or who publicly opposes the proliferation of weapons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67d9fa15-c191-4a78-a9d7-d3d704fbb393",
                                                "sense_id": "ed73966c-6ebf-32a4-aaa8-3aeb6b789ff0",
                                                "text": "If I lift a finger, or my voice, I either throw my support behind those who would prefer a dead planet to a Red planet, or I throw my lot with the Peaceniki."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08a30cf0-f366-4740-89a6-f5a008b136be",
                                                "sense_id": "ed73966c-6ebf-32a4-aaa8-3aeb6b789ff0",
                                                "text": "[Robert] Gillette’s counsel seems one of despair—little or nothing can be done to halt the inexorable movement toward superpower conflict, so don’t be fooled by peaceniki bearing a message of hope."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3f648a1-44cb-442b-a746-721196ae142e",
                                                "sense_id": "ed73966c-6ebf-32a4-aaa8-3aeb6b789ff0",
                                                "text": "THE AMERICAN PEACENIKI / Even if the true believers have not been replaced with KGB agents when Americans visit, it is doubtful that most Russians would speak frankly. Los Angeles Times reporter Robert Gillette quoted a Moscow scientist—who is bitterly opposed to his country’s invasion of Afghanistan—about the naiveté of Americans concerning Soviet statements on their system. […] According to Soviet intellectuals, Americans who swallow their line are fools, commonly called “peaceniki.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccf91e6b-2ea8-4a76-b15d-e6de547d1d24",
                                                "sense_id": "ed73966c-6ebf-32a4-aaa8-3aeb6b789ff0",
                                                "text": "The great bulk of the Western peace movement/left either opposed the Trust Group or were silent on the issue of the well-known repression of the Trusters. They prefered to work with the government front “Soviet Peace Committee,” which offered free trips to the USSR, chauffeurs, and so on to the western “peaceniki” (an insulting term used by the Soviet opposition for the pampered Westerners)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dceecdd1-a36e-4d10-8955-332b6fa93029",
                                                "sense_id": "ed73966c-6ebf-32a4-aaa8-3aeb6b789ff0",
                                                "text": "ps: but that is all a part of the Secret Christian Conspiracy to Drive PeaceNiki Into the Moral Quandary about whether or not they are Tools of the Devil or On God's Side...."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "280a147d-b84c-460e-9ef4-206c4baa6245",
                                                "sense_id": "ed73966c-6ebf-32a4-aaa8-3aeb6b789ff0",
                                                "text": "Tech-hedz & Peaceniki and all others interested in the preparations for the Lunacy that is called Gulf War, part 2 are invited to visit this marvellous web-site."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08bc8b34-3279-40fb-9eea-cafb1236bac1",
                                                "sense_id": "ed73966c-6ebf-32a4-aaa8-3aeb6b789ff0",
                                                "text": "The \"peaceniki\" I know are opposed to human rights violations, whether from Saddam Hussein, Uncle Sam, or others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28bd4509-7d4c-494e-819d-eee2f4633568",
                                                "sense_id": "ed73966c-6ebf-32a4-aaa8-3aeb6b789ff0",
                                                "text": "These kibbutzim have just been obliterated, and some of the last peaceniks are either murdered, burying their loved ones, or held hostage in Gaza."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
